#. Title of the window that explains the Gear tab's two searches.
#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:13
#: src/Panel/Simulate/PanelMenu.cs:82
msgid "Gear search"
msgstr "装备搜索"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:16
msgid "Each set fights the target as in a run. The best by your Rank by stat wins, within your Deaths limit."
msgstr "每套装备都像正式运行那样与目标战斗。按你的排序指标最优且在死亡上限内者胜出。"

#. Start button of a gear search for the best setup of what the character has (gear, prayers, food…).
#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:18
#: src/Panel/Search/StartForm.cs:181
msgid "Find best setup"
msgstr "查找最佳配置"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:20
msgid "Best mix of what you own: gear, plus what's on under Also try."
msgstr "用你拥有的物品组合出最佳：装备，加上“同时尝试”中启用的内容。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:22
msgid "Gather"
msgstr "收集"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:24
msgid "Everything you own and can wear now."
msgstr "你现在拥有且能穿戴的全部物品。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:28
msgid "Bank, worn and your other loadouts. Locked slots stay; items marked Never use are left out."
msgstr "仓库、已穿戴及其他配装。锁定的栏位保持不变；标记为“从不使用”的物品会被排除。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:29
msgid "With Include what I can't use yet, choices you lack and gear you can't wear yet are tried too, and marked."
msgstr "开启“包含我还不能用的”后，缺少的选项和还不能穿的装备也会被尝试并标注。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:34
msgid "Rule out"
msgstr "排除"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:36
msgid "Sets beaten in every stat skip the fight."
msgstr "在每项指标上都落败的套装直接跳过战斗。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:40
msgid "Beaten or matched in every stat that counts against this target."
msgstr "在针对此目标的所有计入指标上均被击败或持平。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:41
msgid "Sets with the same stats against the target fight once."
msgstr "针对此目标属性相同的套装只战斗一次。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:44
msgid "Race"
msgstr "竞速"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:48
#, csharp-format
msgid "Fights in stages: {0} trials."
msgstr "分阶段战斗：{0} 次试验。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:55
msgid "A set clearly behind the leader, or over the death limit, drops out after each stage."
msgstr "明显落后领先者或超出死亡上限的套装会在每个阶段后淘汰。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:56
msgid "Your current gear always stays in, so the gain can be measured."
msgstr "你当前的装备始终保留，以便衡量提升。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:57
#, csharp-format
msgid "{0} trials first when there are {1} sets or more."
msgstr "当套装数达到 {1} 或更多时，先进行 {0} 次试验。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:63
msgid "Too many sets"
msgstr "套装过多"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:66
#, csharp-format
msgid "Over {0}: improves one slot at a time."
msgstr "超过 {0} 套时：每次只改进一个栏位。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:70
#, csharp-format
msgid "Also when fighting them all would take over {0} min, or before any search is timed, over {1} sets."
msgstr "另外，全部战斗会超过 {0} 分钟时，或在任何搜索计时之前超过 {1} 套时，也如此。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:74
#, csharp-format
msgid "Weapon first, then each slot, then set pieces together, until nothing changes or {0} min pass."
msgstr "先武器，再各栏位，再成套装备，直到不再变化或满 {0} 分钟。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:78
msgid "A close second weapon gets its own climb. A better combination may exist."
msgstr "接近的第二武器会单独爬升，但可能存在更优组合。"

#. Gear guide step: trying prayers, spell, imbuement, food and toolbelt after the gear.
#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:82
msgid "Beyond gear"
msgstr "装备之外"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:84
msgid "Then prayers, spell, food and the rest, in turn."
msgstr "然后依次是祝祭、法术、食物及其他。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:88
#, csharp-format
msgid "Prayers one at a time, then pairs of the best {0}."
msgstr "祝祭逐个尝试，再将最好的 {0} 个两两组合。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:89
msgid "When a choice changes, the gear is searched again around it, up to three passes."
msgstr "某选项改变后，会围绕它重新搜索装备，最多三轮。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:90
msgid "Two too close to call fight again, four times as long; the answer names the runner-up."
msgstr "难分高下的两套会再战四倍时长；结果会列出次优方案。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:93
msgid "Answer"
msgstr "结果"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:95
msgid "Best set and its gain, or keep yours if as good."
msgstr "最佳套装及其提升；若你当前的同样好则保留。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:99
msgid "The gain over your setup, with a 95% range, and why it wins."
msgstr "相对你配置的提升、95% 区间及胜出原因。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:100
msgid "Gear alone: of the sets within the best's range or the margin, the one taking least damage; yours if it takes no more."
msgstr "仅装备：在最佳套装区间或容差内的套装中，选受伤最少的；若你当前的受伤不多则保留。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:103
msgid "With Also try: yours if within the best's range, else the highest gain."
msgstr "开启“同时尝试”：若你当前在最佳区间内则保留，否则取提升最大者。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:104
msgid "Cheaper and Safer: as good, using less or taking less damage. Open as setup puts one on side B."
msgstr "更省与更稳：同样好，但更省或受伤更少。点击“作为配置打开”可将其放到 B 方。"

#. Start button of a gear search for which unowned items would gain the most.
#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:107
#: src/Panel/Search/StartForm.cs:183
msgid "Find upgrades"
msgstr "查找升级"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:109
msgid "Items you don't own yet, by what they'd gain."
msgstr "你尚未拥有的物品，按可带来的提升排序。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:111
msgid "Every item you don't own and can wear."
msgstr "所有你未拥有且可穿戴的物品。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:114
msgid "Items you can't wear yet are listed with what they need, and never fought."
msgstr "你还不能穿戴的物品会连同所需条件列出，且不参与战斗。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:116
msgid "Items beaten in every stat skip the fight."
msgstr "在每项指标上都落败的物品直接跳过战斗。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:119
msgid "Beaten or matched by another unowned item for its slot, in every stat that counts."
msgstr "在同栏位的另一件未拥有物品上，所有计入指标均被击败或持平。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:121
msgid "Swap and fight"
msgstr "替换并战斗"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:123
msgid "Each item alone in your gear, raced against it."
msgstr "每件物品单独替换进你的装备，与之竞速。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:125
msgid "The same stages as Find best setup, judged against your gear alone."
msgstr "与“查找最佳配置”相同的阶段，仅以你当前装备为基准评判。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:127
msgid "Gains by source, largest first. Click one to try it on B."
msgstr "按来源分组的提升，从大到小。点击可在 B 方试用。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:131
msgid "Safer lists items as good that take clearly less damage."
msgstr "“更稳”会列出明显受伤更少的同等好物品。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:132
msgid "Click others to try them together; click one again to take it out."
msgstr "点击其他物品可一起试用；再次点击可移除。"

#. Gear search guide button that hides the Gear tab's (i) button; Settings shows it again.
#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:136
msgid "Hide guide button"
msgstr "隐藏指南按钮"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:138
msgid "Hides the (i) on the Gear tab. Settings shows it again."
msgstr "隐藏“装备”标签上的 (i)。可在设置中重新显示。"

#: src/Panel/Help/GearGuideText.cs:140
msgid "Answers are kept per character and target."
msgstr "结果按角色和目标分别保留。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:14
msgctxt "CS2 help"
msgid "Guide"
msgstr "指南"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:17
msgid "CS2 runs the game's combat code on a copy of your character and records the results."
msgstr "CS2 在你的角色副本上运行游戏的战斗代码并记录结果。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:19
msgid "Snapshot"
msgstr "快照"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:22
msgid "CS2 saves your character to memory, including gear, prayers, potions and bonuses."
msgstr "CS2 将你的角色存入内存，包括装备、祝祭、药水和加成。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:24
msgid "Fight"
msgstr "战斗"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:35
#, csharp-format
msgid "A separate copy of the game fights each target {0} time."
msgid_plural "A separate copy of the game fights each target {0} times."
msgstr[0] "一个独立的游戏副本会将每个目标战斗 {0} 次。"
msgstr[1] "一个独立的游戏副本会将每个目标战斗 {0} 次。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:41
#, csharp-format
msgid "A separate copy of the game fights each target up to {0} time."
msgid_plural "A separate copy of the game fights each target up to {0} times."
msgstr[0] "一个独立的游戏副本会将每个目标战斗至多 {0} 次。"
msgstr[1] "一个独立的游戏副本会将每个目标战斗至多 {0} 次。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:47
#, csharp-format
msgid "Copies inside your game fight each target {0} time."
msgid_plural "Copies inside your game fight each target {0} times."
msgstr[0] "游戏内的副本会将每个目标战斗 {0} 次。"
msgstr[1] "游戏内的副本会将每个目标战斗 {0} 次。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:53
#, csharp-format
msgid "Copies inside your game fight each target up to {0} time."
msgid_plural "Copies inside your game fight each target up to {0} times."
msgstr[0] "游戏内的副本会将每个目标战斗至多 {0} 次。"
msgstr[1] "游戏内的副本会将每个目标战斗至多 {0} 次。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:62
msgid "Measure"
msgstr "统计"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:65
#, csharp-format
msgid "CS2 turns the results into rates {0}, each with a range."
msgstr "CS2 将结果换算为速率 {0}，每项都带区间。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:68
#, csharp-format
msgid "XP {0}"
msgstr "经验 {0}"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:70
msgid "CS2 is 95% sure the rate is in this range."
msgstr "CS2 有 95% 把握认为速率在此区间内。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:84
msgid "In every fight"
msgstr "每场战斗中"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:86
msgid "Each result lists all of its assumptions."
msgstr "每个结果都会列出其全部假设。"

#. Heading over the Guide's rows that say what CS2 can do: simulate, compare, find gear, Slayer.
#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:89
msgid "What you can do"
msgstr "你能做什么"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:93
msgid "Rank every target by any rate. Click one for its fights."
msgstr "按任意速率排列所有目标。点击可查看其战斗详情。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:99
msgid "Fight details: chance to hit and damage, both ways, with ranges."
msgstr "战斗详情：双方的命中率与伤害，均带区间。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:100
msgid "Close calls: fights won where one more top hit would have killed."
msgstr "险胜：获胜的战斗中，若再挨一次最高伤害就会死亡。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:101
msgid "Ran over: a fight past the time limit counts as no kill and no death."
msgstr "超时：超过时间上限的战斗不计击杀也不计死亡。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:104
#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:207
#: src/Panel/Simulate/ComparePicker.cs:50
#: src/Panel/Simulate/ComparePicker.cs:225
#: src/Panel/Simulate/ComparePicker.cs:378
msgid "Compare"
msgstr "对比"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:106
msgid "Setup A against B, target by target."
msgstr "配置 A 对 B，逐目标对比。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:112
msgid "+ Compare starts B from a copy of yours, a loadout, a preset or a saved run."
msgstr "“+ 对比”可从你的副本、配装、预设或已保存运行开始 B 方。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:113
msgid "Each target shows which side is better and by how much."
msgstr "每个目标都会显示哪方更好及差距多少。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:114
msgid "Better and Worse show only where B is clearly ahead or behind."
msgstr "“更好”和“更差”只显示 B 明显领先或落后的目标。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:115
msgid "⇅ swaps the sides; ✕ Clear goes back to one setup."
msgstr "⇅ 交换双方；✕ 清除可回到单个配置。"

#. Guide row title for the Gear tab's two searches.
#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:119
msgid "Find gear"
msgstr "查找装备"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:121
msgid "Best set of what you own; upgrades you don't."
msgstr "你拥有的最佳套装；以及你未拥有的升级。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:127
#, csharp-format
msgid "A set within the best's 95% range or the margin ({0}) is as good; then yours wins."
msgstr "在最佳套装 95% 区间或容差（{0}）内的套装视为同样好；此时优先你的。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:131
msgid "For an area or the pins, each target counts the same."
msgstr "针对一个区域或固定目标，每个目标权重相同。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:132
msgid "How it searches: (i) on the Gear tab."
msgstr "搜索方式：见“装备”标签上的 (i)。"

#. Guide row title for Slayer masters and the Slayer page.
#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:136
#: src/Panel/SetupTab/PageList.cs:53
#: src/Panel/Simulate/TargetFilters.cs:63
msgid "Slayer"
msgstr "屠杀者"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:138
msgid "Masters as targets; best loadouts and blocks per master."
msgstr "以大师为目标；给出每位大师的最佳配装与屏蔽。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:144
msgid "A master's monsters fight on task, weighted by how long their tasks take."
msgstr "大师的怪物在任务状态下战斗，按任务耗时加权。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:145
msgid "The Slayer page tries your loadouts and blocks; nothing changes in your game."
msgstr "屠杀者页面会试用你的配装与屏蔽；你的游戏不会有任何改变。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:146
msgid "Your tasks: which to extend or reroll."
msgstr "你的任务：该延长还是重抽。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:149
msgid "CS2 does not change or edit your game."
msgstr "CS2 不会改动或编辑你的游戏。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:151
msgid "Start tour"
msgstr "开始导览"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:170
msgid "You start at full HP"
msgstr "以满生命值开局"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:171
msgid "Food and ammo never run out"
msgstr "食物和弹药永不耗尽"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:172
msgid "Your levels stay the same"
msgstr "等级保持不变"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:173
msgid "You lose no items on death"
msgstr "死亡不掉落物品"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:177
msgid "Skip tour"
msgstr "跳过导览"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:179
msgid "Back"
msgstr "上一步"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:181
msgid "Next"
msgstr "下一步"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:183
msgid "Done"
msgstr "完成"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:186
#: src/Panel/SetupTab/EntriesPage.Rows.cs:181
