#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:195
msgid "Your setup"
msgstr "你的配置"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:196
msgid "What you fight with. Click a slot to change it; right-click puts it back or empties it. Edit opens the Setup tab for levels, prayers, spells and more."
msgstr "你作战所用的内容。点击栏位可更换；右键可还原或清空。“编辑”打开配置页，可调等级、祝祭、法术等。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:201
#: src/Panel/Simulate/TargetStrip.cs:217
msgid "Targets"
msgstr "目标"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:202
msgid "Open this to see what will be simulated. Click a monster to ignore it. The filters to its left narrow the list."
msgstr "打开可查看将要模拟的内容。点击怪物可忽略它。左侧筛选可缩小列表。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:207
msgid "Two setups"
msgstr "两个配置"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:209
msgid "A is compared to B, target by target. ⇅ swaps them. ✕ Clear goes back to one setup."
msgstr "A 与 B 逐目标对比。⇅ 交换两者。✕ 清除可回到单个配置。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:210
msgid "+ Compare adds a second setup: a copy of yours to change, a loadout, a preset or a saved run. Each target then shows which is better and by how much."
msgstr "“+ 对比”添加第二个配置：可改动的你的副本、配装、预设或已保存运行。之后每个目标会显示哪方更好及差距。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:217
msgid "A run is going. This button cancels it."
msgstr "正在运行。此按钮可取消。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:219
msgid "Each result shows as its target finishes."
msgstr "每个目标完成后即显示其结果。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:222
msgid "Read the results"
msgstr "查看结果"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:223
msgid "Results show here after a run. Rank them by any stat. Click one for its details."
msgstr "运行结束后结果显示在此。可按任意指标排序。点击可看详情。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:225
msgid "Each bar is a target: its height is the stat you rank by, its colour how often you die there, its whisker the 95% range. Hover for numbers, click for details, shift-click to pin. Click a portrait to ignore that target, or an area's name to fold it into one bar."
msgstr "每根柱代表一个目标：高度为排序指标，颜色为在该处死亡的频率，须线为 95% 区间。悬停看数值，点击看详情，Shift+点击固定。点击头像可忽略该目标，点击区域名可折叠为一根柱。"

#: src/Panel/Help/HelpText.cs:228
msgid "Rank by any stat. Click a row for its details. Pin up to three, then View side by side."
msgstr "按任意指标排序。点击行看详情。最多固定三个，然后并排查看。"

#: src/Panel/PanelPins.cs:124
#, csharp-format
msgid "pins full ({0}, {1} waiting): unpin one or clear"
msgstr "固定已满（{0} 个，{1} 个等待）：取消一个或清除"

#: src/Panel/PanelPins.cs:125
#, csharp-format
msgid "pins full ({0}): unpin one first"
